        "rating": 4,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "A flexible contractor and impeccable work. Very fair rates, I recommend him.",
        "time": 1572789322,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Karine Mata",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/100357551749456292261/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXRf7eihXrOCVEz-JCuma0vEDkObXdPDXnJ741L9Yy57WuURQP1=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "6 years ago",
        "text": "Dishonest plasterer contractor!!! I'll tell you, I'm in Sainte-Marthe-sur-le-lac, I was flooded at two houses, so I needed a plasterer, I called several through the ads in the yellow pages, they were all taken. So I came across Mr. Mario Bienvenue who said he was available, I explained to the gentleman by phone that he must be in order and have all his papers, including the RBQ because I have to hand everything over to public security to be entitled to a certain reimbursement to which I am entitled, he told me no problem, his company is in order. Mario comes to my house, gives me my quote and before giving him the ok, I repeat to him that I will need a complete invoice, he reassures me that everything is ok.... to make a long story short, the work on two basements, bachalos to be plastered, he and around 3 colleagues lasted almost 2 months, I did not seem to be his priority, he always had a good excuse and asked to be paid and made me feel like he was afraid of not being paid which was likely to be the case....about 1 week before the end I asked him by phone to bring me my invoice since he had been paid in full the week before to tell me that he does not have an RBQ he even allowed himself to shout at me...well let's see he does not even have the right to work without an RBQ number!!! the next day while I was at work he came by not to go to work but to pick up his materials he never finished his work and I never received my invoices I will not be reimbursed for his work he no longer answers the phone and has disappeared do not do business with him even if you are in a hurry",
        "time": 1570408735,
        "translated": true
      },
